            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Employees in the Network Assistant title will be placed in Wage Schedule N-8. Since this title is intended to be a developmental position, employees in the Network Assistant title may not bid on other job opportunities unless they are subject to force adjustment. Upon successful completion of all training, testing, and performance",
